step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>To begin, sail to <col=800000>Wyrmscraig</col>, found slightly south-west of <col=800000>Charred Island</col>. Be sure not to bring a <col=800000>sloop</col>, as it will not fit in a cave entered later in the quest.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>To begin, sail to Wyrmscraig, found slightly south-west of Charred Island. Be sure not to bring a sloop, as it will not fit in a cave entered later in the quest.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Dock at the island and try to run onto the island, and you will be stopped by <col=800000>Ffion</col>.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>To begin, sail to Wyrmscraig, found slightly south-west of Charred Island. Be sure not to bring a sloop, as it will not fit in a cave entered later in the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Dock at the island and try to run onto the island, and you will be stopped by Ffion.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Run to Auchrie and speak to <col=800000>Cormac</col> in the centre hut.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>To begin, sail to Wyrmscraig, found slightly south-west of Charred Island. Be sure not to bring a sloop, as it will not fit in a cave entered later in the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Dock at the island and try to run onto the island, and you will be stopped by Ffion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run to Auchrie and speak to Cormac in the centre hut.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>Muriel</col> in the building immediately north-east of Cormac's hut, then run to the closest area marked on the map with the <col=800000>Mining</col> icon.</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>To begin, sail to Wyrmscraig, found slightly south-west of Charred Island. Be sure not to bring a sloop, as it will not fit in a cave entered later in the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Dock at the island and try to run onto the island, and you will be stopped by Ffion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run to Auchrie and speak to Cormac in the centre hut.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Muriel in the building immediately north-east of Cormac's hut, then run to the closest area marked on the map with the Mining icon.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Search the tent for a pickaxe, hammer, and chisel if needed, then inspect the <col=800000>sunstone monolith</col>.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>To begin, sail to Wyrmscraig, found slightly south-west of Charred Island. Be sure not to bring a sloop, as it will not fit in a cave entered later in the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Dock at the island and try to run onto the island, and you will be stopped by Ffion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run to Auchrie and speak to Cormac in the centre hut.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Muriel in the building immediately north-east of Cormac's hut, then run to the closest area marked on the map with the Mining icon.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the tent for a pickaxe, hammer, and chisel if needed, then inspect the sunstone monolith.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Mine a piece off the <col=800000>sunstone monolith</col>, and chisel it into a <col=800000>sunstone core</col>. The <col=800000>scrawled notebook</col> may be dropped.</col>
